    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Galactic Vanguard</i> is a retro creation that pays homage to classic 90s action shooters, with pixel art meticulously designed to transport players back to the golden age of arcade gaming. As a lone warrior, armed with powerful weapons, you'll battle through harsh environments and face countless enemies in life-or-death struggles. The level designs are filled with challenges, ranging from icy mountains to deep underground caves, from scorching lava valleys to eerie alien nests. Each location is uniquely crafted, and enemies vary from mechanical armies to alien creatures, providing a rich and thrilling gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Classic pixel art style takes you back to the 90s, merging retro aesthetics with modern design for a unique visual impact. Each scene is packed with nostalgic details, sure to resonate with veteran arcade players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.poster.avif?t=1742522026\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.webm?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.mp4?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 A diverse weapon system allows for tactical flexibility. Players can wield laser guns, energy shields, shotguns, charge cannons, flamethrowers, and more. Each weapon has distinct attack patterns and effects, allowing players to craft their own combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.poster.avif?t=1742522026\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.webm?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.mp4?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 When facing powerful bosses, the game\u2019s difficulty intensifies. Each boss has unique attack patterns and weaknesses. Players must skillfully use their weapons and abilities, dodge attacks, and strike precisely to claim victory. Quick reflexes and strategic thinking are essential to surviving these challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers not only smooth and exciting combat but also the satisfaction of exploring deep space and defeating formidable foes. With a variety of environments, enemy types, and adrenaline-pumping boss fights, you'll be fully immersed, enjoying the endless thrill of battle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Galactic Vanguard</i> is a retro creation that pays homage to classic 90s action shooters, with pixel art meticulously designed to transport players back to the golden age of arcade gaming. As a lone warrior, armed with powerful weapons, you'll battle through harsh environments and face countless enemies in life-or-death struggles. The level designs are filled with challenges, ranging from icy mountains to deep underground caves, from scorching lava valleys to eerie alien nests. Each location is uniquely crafted, and enemies vary from mechanical armies to alien creatures, providing a rich and thrilling gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Classic pixel art style takes you back to the 90s, merging retro aesthetics with modern design for a unique visual impact. Each scene is packed with nostalgic details, sure to resonate with veteran arcade players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.poster.avif?t=1742522026\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.webm?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/4ad96321687b11f27f68d4570aac7aae.mp4?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 A diverse weapon system allows for tactical flexibility. Players can wield laser guns, energy shields, shotguns, charge cannons, flamethrowers, and more. Each weapon has distinct attack patterns and effects, allowing players to craft their own combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.poster.avif?t=1742522026\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.webm?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308800/extras/c2c77a9013b02111e1682377c90a3bfb.mp4?t=1742522026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 When facing powerful bosses, the game\u2019s difficulty intensifies. Each boss has unique attack patterns and weaknesses. Players must skillfully use their weapons and abilities, dodge attacks, and strike precisely to claim victory. Quick reflexes and strategic thinking are essential to surviving these challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers not only smooth and exciting combat but also the satisfaction of exploring deep space and defeating formidable foes. With a variety of environments, enemy types, and adrenaline-pumping boss fights, you'll be fully immersed, enjoying the endless thrill of battle.</p>",
    "short_description": "Galactic Vanguard is a fast-paced, retro-style action shooter. Grab your weapons and eliminate relentless enemy forces and powerful alien creatures. Engage in intense battles across space bases, desert wastelands, lava valleys, and abandoned alien ruins!",
